==Trivia==
*Playing Pirates' Japanese name, Nanchatte Kaizoku (なんちゃって海賊, "Pretend Pirates"), is a reference to ''Nanchatte Kazoku'' (なんちゃって家族, "Pretend Family"), the Japanese name of the movie [[wikipedia:We're the Millers|''We're the Millers'']].

